telemetry-only local commits.\n- Invoke the existing train synchronously, retaining its combined CI, claim, lease and post-push checks. Keep individual merges as the existing default path and record refused or incomplete batches for reconciliation.\n- Provide a runtime deployment patch, activation instructions and protocol notes. Runtime activation and the first live batch remain downstream of publication and independent review.\n\n### Testing\n- The author passed 26 focused adapter/claim/synchronization tests, including seven adapter cases. The runtime patch passed a zero-fuzz dry-run and its offline preview passed shell syntax validation.\n- The author's first normal hook run was interrupted at its task deadline (exit 130). MAIN reran the normal commit against the unchanged staged files: 736 tests passed with 9 skipped in 234.737 seconds.\n- MAIN verified the clean local commit, all six source-file hashes and the three unchanged active-runtime hashes. No daemon installation, restart or live train has run.\n- Exact published-head CI and fresh independent review are pending.\n\n---\nAddresses #593\n", "created_at": "2026-09-18T06:10:44Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T06:10:47Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": "8c71f2b29da7fe0ac8b3fde5c9233cd5b6f999df", "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "labels": [{"id": 12025011061, "node_id": "LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8bdQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/infrastructure", "name": "infrastructure", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": "Foundational definitions, shared APIs, or supporting layers", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "milestone": null, "draft": false, "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/595/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/595/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls